      "name": "Ash Form",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The ash skeleton crumbles to ash or reforms in a standing position. While ash, the ash skeleton is Immobile, Off-Guard, and has an automatic result of 26 on Deception checks and DCs to pass as an inanimate pile of ash or layer of soot.</p>\n<p>The ash skeleton can remain in this ash form indefinitely.</p>",
